      163.17,
      201.77,
      377.61,
      224.75
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE VIDYAWASA SOCIAL SERVICEASSOCIATION LIMITED",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      150.81,
      236.81,
      389.89,
      306.71
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS an Association called and known as the \u201cSriVidyawasa Social Service Association Limited\u201d hasheretofore been formed at Mini Oluwa, Meerigama in SriLanka, for the purpose of effectually carrying out andtransacting all objects and matters connected with the saidAssociation, according to the rules agreed to by its members:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      150.81,
      318.77,
      389.9,
      376.91
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Association has heretoforsuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the application:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      150.81,
      388.97,
      389.96,
      411.95
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefor enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      150.81,
      424.01,
      389.88,
      458.75
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the \u201cSri Vidyawasa SocialService Association Limited\u201d (Incorporation) Act, No. of2016.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      150.81,
      470.81,
      389.9,
      599.15
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so many persons as presently are members of the\u201cSri Vidyawasa Social Service Association Limited\u201d(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cAssociation\u201d) or shall hereafterbe admitted members of the Corporation hereby constitutedshall be a body corporate (hereinafter referred to as \u201ctheCorporation\u201d) with perpetual succession, under the name andstyle of the \u201cSri Vidyawasa Social Service AssociationLimited\u201d, and by that name may sue and be sued in all courtswith full power and authority to have and use a common sealand to alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      150.81,
      611.21,
      389.89,
      634.31
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are herby declared to be \u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      166.05,
      646.37,
      389.85,
      669.59
    ],
    "text": "(a)to take necessary steps for the propagation ofBuddha Sasanaya ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
